\n23:16\n10:04\n09:48\n17:53\n10:50\n07:06\n22:51\n09:41\n20:10\n16:05\n22:56\n09:43\n19:08\n18:05\n23:17\n18:08\n21:02\n09:49\n10:07\n23:56\n15:09\n06:21\n15:42\n08:32\n22:10\n06:39\n11:14\n21:10\n18:49\n09:10\n05:35\n07:51\n15:13\n10:46\n20:22\n23:30\n05:31\n06:05\n21:56\n07:43\n18:24\n12:29\n16:57\n08:13\n12:40\n07:33\n07:53\n10:54\n17:16\n08:11\n18:37\n06:47\n08:27\n06:43\n19:11\n06:49\n20:03\n10:50\n16:20\n17:42\n16:10\n09:42\n21:09\n17:29\n17:00\n10:24\n18:16\n12:16\n11:39\n18:41\n05:04\n16:57\n17:21\n23:46\n12:00\n12:12\n07:07\n10:31\n16:05\n06:58\n20:08\n22:48\n07:09\n16:46\n11:39\n16:35\n07:55\n22:58\n23:42\n11:25\n22:09\n14:43\n15:13\n17:05\n09:19\n19:03\n06:19\n","stdout":"1"}]', 'def minutes(text):
    h, m = text.strip().split(":")
    return int(h) * 60 + int(m)


now = minutes(input())
n = int(input())
best = 1440
for _ in range(n):
    bus = minutes(input())
    wait = (bus - now) % 1440  # a bus earlier today is that time tomorrow
    best = min(best, wait)
print(best)
