INSERT OR IGNORE INTO problems (slug, title, body, difficulty, tags, starter, cases, solution, source_url, status, created_by) VALUES ('range-sums', 'Range sums', 'The robotics team''s sensor logged one reading per second for N seconds. The team has Q questions, each of the form: what is the total of the readings from second l to second r, counting both ends?

## Input

The first line has N and Q. The second line has the N readings a1 to aN. Each of the next Q lines has two integers l and r.

## Output

Print Q lines. Line i is the answer to question i: the sum al + ... + ar.

## Constraints

- 1 ≤ N ≤ 30,000 and 1 ≤ Q ≤ 6,000
- 0 ≤ each reading ≤ 1,000,000,000
- 1 ≤ l ≤ r ≤ N (seconds are numbered from 1)
- An answer can be larger than 2,147,483,647.

## Sample input

```
5 3
3 1 4 1 5
1 3
2 5
4 4
```

## Sample output

```
8
11
1
